<view class="notice">独立体验环境 · 短信、支付与退款均为模拟</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="requestId" class="notice">{{item.actionText}} · {{item.statusText}}<button size="mini" data-id="{{item.requestId}}" bindtap="retry">原请求重试</button></view><view class="page"><view wx:if="{{!order}}" class="empty">登录并刷新以查看此行程。<button bindtap="refresh">刷新</button></view><block wx:if="{{order}}"><view class="title">{{order.stageText}}</view><view class="muted">{{order.kindText}}</view><map class="map" latitude="{{mapLat}}" longitude="{{mapLng}}" markers="{{markers}}" scale="13" show-location="{{false}}"/><view class="muted">仅展示所选地点与司机上报坐标，不含真实导航路线。</view><view class="card"><view class="route">上车 · {{order.origin}}</view><view wx:for="{{order.waypoints}}" wx:key="index" class="route">途经 · {{item.name}}</view><view class="route">到达 · {{order.destinationPending?'目的地待补充':order.destination}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.scheduledAt}}">预约：{{order.scheduledAtText}}</view><view class="subtitle">{{order.fareText}}</view><view class="muted">{{order.fareSourceText}}</view><view class="muted">{{order.destinationPending?'费用未确定，不代表免费':'独立体验报价'}} · {{order.paymentStatusText}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.driver}}" class="point"><view class="subtitle">{{order.driver.name}} · {{order.driver.plate}}</view><view>{{order.driver.vehicleModel}} {{order.driver.mobileMasked}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.driver.location}}" class="muted">位置上报时间：{{order.driver.location.receivedAtText}}</view><view class="muted">真实电话中继未配置，请勿将本环境用于真实出行。</view></view><view wx:if="{{order.rider}}">乘车人：{{order.rider.name}} · {{order.rider.mobileMasked}}</view><view>备注：{{order.remark || '无'}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.adjustments.length}}" class="notice">费用有调整，请重新核对当前金额。<view wx:for="{{order.adjustments}}" wx:key="fareVersion">¥{{item.beforeText}} → ¥{{item.afterText}} · {{item.reason}} · {{item.atText}}</view></view></view><view wx:if="{{order.kind==='BID' && order.stage==='AVAILABLE'}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">司机报价</view><view class="muted">有效期截至 {{order.expiresAtText}}（独立体验策略）</view><view wx:if="{{!order.bids.length}}" class="empty">等待司机报价</view><view wx:for="{{order.bids}}" wx:key="driverId" class="point"><view>{{item.name}} · {{item.plate}}</view><view>{{item.vehicleModel}}</view><button class="primary" data-id="{{item.driverId}}" bindtap="selectDriver" disabled="{{busy}}">选择 ¥{{item.money}}</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{order.stage==='WAIT_CONTINUE'}}" class="card"><view>司机已取消接驾，是否继续呼叫？</view><button class="primary" data-type="1" bindtap="continueTrip">同一订单继续叫车</button><button data-type="2" bindtap="continueTrip">放弃继续</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.kind==='NEGOTIATED'}}" class="card"><view>议价状态：{{order.negotiationStatusText}}</view><view wx:if="{{order.stage==='PREPAY'}}"><textarea placeholder="价格有异议？说明原因，等待司机重新报价" data-field="dispute" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="dispute" disabled="{{busy}}">提交价格异议</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.negotiationStatus==='DISPUTED'}}" class="notice">已提出异议，等待司机重新报价后才能模拟支付。</view></view><button wx:if="{{(order.stage==='PREPAY' || order.stage==='WAIT_PAY') && order.negotiationStatus!=='DISPUTED'}}" class="primary" bindtap="pay" disabled="{{busy}}">确认 {{order.fareText}} 并模拟支付</button><view wx:if="{{!order.destinationPending && order.stage==='AVAILABLE' && !order.bids.length}}" class="card"><view class="muted">司机尚未报价或接单时可修改目的地；修改后由服务端重新计算体验估价。</view><button bindtap="destination">地图修改目的地</button><button bindtap="existingDestination">已有 / 体验地点修改目的地</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.destinationPending && (order.stage==='AVAILABLE' || order.stage==='PICKUP' || order.stage==='ARRIVED')}}" class="card"><view class="notice">司机开始行程前须补齐目的地。</view><button bindtap="destination">地图补充目的地</button><button bindtap="existingDestination">已有 / 体验地点补充目的地</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.stage==='AVAILABLE' || order.stage==='PREPAY' || order.stage==='RESERVED' || order.stage==='PICKUP' || order.stage==='ARRIVED' || order.stage==='WAIT_CONTINUE'}}" class="card"><textarea placeholder="更新给司机的备注" data-field="remark" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="remark" disabled="{{busy}}">保存备注</button><button class="danger" bindtap="cancel" disabled="{{busy}}">取消行程</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.stage==='DONE'}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">评价行程</view><view wx:if="{{order.evaluation}}">{{order.evaluation.rating}} 星 · {{order.evaluation.content}}</view><block wx:else><input type="number" maxlength="1" value="{{rating}}" placeholder="1—5星" data-field="rating" bindinput="input"/><textarea placeholder="说说乘车体验（可选）" data-field="review" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="evaluate" disabled="{{busy}}">提交评价</button></block><button data-url="/pages/settings/index?section=invoices" bindtap="go">申请模拟开票回执</button></view><view wx:if="{{order.stage==='DONE' || order.stage==='CANCELLED' || order.stage==='WAIT_PAY'}}" class="card"><view class="subtitle">行程问题</view><textarea placeholder="描述投诉问题，客服后台可查看和回复" data-field="complaint" bindinput="input"/><button bindtap="complain" disabled="{{busy}}">提交投诉</button><button wx:if="{{order.driver}}" bindtap="block" disabled="{{busy}}">屏蔽此司机后续接单</button><view wx:for="{{order.complaints}}" wx:key="id" class="point"><view>{{item.content}} · {{item.statusText}}</view><view>{{item.reply}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.attachments}}" wx:for-item="attachment" wx:key="id">已保存图片 {{index+1}}（{{attachment.size}} 字节）</view><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="attach">添加图片（最多3张）</button></view><button bindtap="again">使用这些地点再次叫车</button></view><view class="card"><view class="subtitle">行程记录</view><view class="muted">以下时间均为北京时间</view><view wx:for="{{order.events}}" wx:key="index" class="muted">{{item.typeText}} · {{item.atText}}</view><view class="muted">订单编号：{{order.id}}</view></view></block></view>